Hi Maya,

Meet Pinegrove Kitchen Display: tickets go straight from the register to a screen at the bar, with timers and color-coded rush alerts.

Kitchen Display is available as an add-on for $25 per screen per month, or included free in Pinegrove Enterprise, which starts at $149 per register per month.

Early access customers get their first two months free. Join the waitlist at pinegrovepos.example/kds.

